msgid "FmodSoundLock"
msgstr "FmodSoundLock"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:14 17a5ddd99e3d41778c600b3df340cb1d
msgid "**Inherits:** :ref:`RefCounted<class_RefCounted>` **<** :ref:`Object<class_Object>`"
msgstr "**继承：** :ref:`RefCounted<class_RefCounted>` **<** :ref:`Object<class_Object>`"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:16 707b98e19e9b424fb00eec0f7abaa6a9
msgid "Provides direct access to sound sample data for reading or modification."
msgstr "提供对声音样本数据的直接访问，以进行读取或修改"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:21 196130ff8d6849a491348794f4938092
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:23 0bd2547fea4a4808bc2bffb78052a7aa
msgid ""
"FmodSoundLock is used to lock a region of sound data for direct access. This allows reading or "
"modifying the raw sample data of a sound."
msgstr "FmodSoundLock 用于锁定声音数据的区域以进行直接访问。这允许读取或修改声音的原始采样数据"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:25 a06c26b7bd4340a38c9ca78979549c40
msgid ""
"When a sound is locked, FMOD provides one or two pointers to the data (two pointers are used if "
"the locked region wraps around the end of the sound buffer)."
msgstr "当声音被锁定时，FMOD 会提供一个或两个指向数据的指针（如果锁定的区域绕过了声音缓冲区的末尾，则使用两个指针）"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:27 0360a5e3ef3d40258f46dfe05b16822f
msgid ""
"\\ **Important:** Always call :ref:`unlock()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_unlock>` when finished "
"accessing the data, or use the RAII pattern (let the object go out of scope) to automatically "
"unlock."
msgstr ""
"**重要：**    数据访问结束后应调用    :ref:`unlock()<class_FmodSoundLock_method_unlock>`   ，也可让对象离开作用域，利用 RAII"
" 自动解锁。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:29 f0b595dd4489450a882ba37523ea94a3
msgid ""
"\\ **Note:** Locking a sound may be expensive as it can block the mixer thread. Use sparingly and"
" for short durations."
msgstr "**注意：**    锁定声音可能阻塞混音线程，开销较大，应减少使用频率和持有时间。"

