msgid "Returns the second portion of locked data as a byte array."
msgstr "返回锁定数据的第二部分作为    ``PackedByteArray``   ，只有当锁定区域绕过声音缓冲区的末端时，这部分才非空"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsoundlock.rst:102 b5fb37565dd641bba7cfcfb5426cbcbf
msgid "This is only non-empty when the locked region wraps around the end of the sound buffer."
msgstr "只有锁定区域跨越声音缓冲区末尾时，此数组才非空。"

